   "va": "0x180194120",
   "behavior": "Reads axis pair (r8d,r9d). Optional per-handler radial check when flag arg is set and ApplyDeadZone. Then if x*x+y*y < DeadZone*DeadZone returns VecZero (0x180194308..0x18019431d), else returns raw (x,y) unscaled."
  },
  "left_stick": "InputHandler::HandleInput 0x180194e1d GetStickValue(axes 0,1) stored to InputHandler+0x58; PlayerUnitInput::DirectMovement 0x1802ee023..0x1802ee04e adds that stick vector to InputHandler::GetDirection (digital Up/Down/Left/Right control states, normalized) as movement input.",
  "right_stick": "GetStickValue(axes 2,3) is called only by InputHandler::FreeFormSelect 0x180194f88 (gamepad menu cursor/free-form selection) and Player::HandleInput 0x180211bd6 (any-input-given detection). PlayerUnitInput CalcTargetInfo/ReticleMovement/DirectMovement reference only InputHandler::GetDirection; no right-stick aim was found.",
  "not_recovered": "GamePadHandler::CheckDirectionsAndApplyDeadZone 0x180194340 (stick-as-digital menu directions) thresholds were not decoded."
 },
 "android_adaptation": {
  "gamepad": "Standard Android Xbox-layout correspondence: AKEYCODE_BUTTON_A(96)->PadButtonA, B(97)->B, X(99)->X, Y(100)->Y, L1(102)->L1, R1(103)->R1, L2(104)->L2, R2(105)->R2, THUMBL(106)->L3, THUMBR(107)->R3, START(108)->Start, SELECT(109)->Select, DPAD_UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT(19/20/21/22)->Up/Down/Left/Right. AXIS_X/Y->axes 0/1 (Y negated to engine positive-up), AXIS_Z/RZ->axes 2/3 (Y negated), LTRIGGER/RTRIGGER->axes 4/5 and digital L2/R2 when >= 1/255 (the original nonzero-byte test), HAT_X/HAT_Y->D-pad at |value|>=0.5 (adaptation threshold).",
  "keyboard": "AKEYCODE_A..Z, 0..9, SPACE, ENTER, DEL(backspace), ESCAPE, SHIFT_LEFT, F10, F11, and arrow keys (delivered as AKEYCODE_DPAD_* from keyboard sources) mapped to the corresponding KeyboardButtonId. Callers must use the event source (keyboard vs gamepad) because DPAD keycodes are shared.",
  "mouse": "Android delivers mouse buttons through AMotionEvent button state (BUTTON_PRIMARY=1, SECONDARY=2, TERTIARY=4, BACK=8, FORWARD=16) and wheel through AXIS_VSCROLL; mapped to MouseButtons Left/Right/Middle/XButton1/XButton2/WheelUp/WheelDown. XButton1->BUTTON_BACK is an adaptation assumption. Some devices convert unconsumed secondary clicks to AKEYCODE_BACK."
 },
